# PTK Rotation Patch for Wii U GamePad WiFi
#
# Nintendo rotates the PTK (Pairwise Transient Key) 3 bytes to the left
# after computation, making it incompatible with standard WPA2.
#
# This patch NOPs out the two memcpy calls that perform the rotation
# at the end of the key expansion function (0x24B78).
#
# Reference: https://libdrc.org/docs/re/wifi.html
#
# Flash addresses: Partition2 (0x500000) + WIFI (0xBC310) + offset

# First memcpy(3 bytes) - NOP it out
# BL 0x17D0 -> NOP NOP
0x5E0F56:DCF7C3FD:00BF00BF

# Second memcpy(3 bytes) - NOP it out
# BL 0x17D0 -> NOP NOP
0x5E0F60:DCF7BEFD:00BF00BF

# CRC32 update - must reflect ALL patches (OUI + rotation)
# Previous CRC (OUI-only): 0x7C209717
# New CRC (all patches):   0x58E47773
0x5F9630:1797207C:7377E458
